 if(s.kind==='delayed'&&/\\b(?:ReferenceError|TypeError)\\b|is not defined|Cannot (?:read|access)/i.test(s.error))return 'An internal app error stopped this update. Reconnecting will not fix it. The app needs a corrected release; include Diagnostics when reporting it. Saved data remains available.';
